; Pulsar Drive: made by tools/compose.py from music/pulsar_drive.compose.toml
; (space, D minor, 120 bpm, seed 3). Run the recipe
; again after changing it, or edit this file by hand. Chords from
; free-midi-chords by Ludovic Drolez (MIT, tools/progressions.toml).
;
; A: i VI VII v (minor): Dm Bb C Am
; B: v i iv VII (minor): Am Dm Gm C
; Form, 8 bars each: intro A | theme A | theme A | bridge B | bridge B | break A | theme A | bridge B | theme A | turn B
; Variation: most (every fourth bar walks and pushes, the broken chords turn, ghost notes on the hi-hat, later themes answer backwards).

#title Pulsar Drive
#tempo 120
; Layers by the game's tension (music.intensity): the pads and the bass always.
#layer D 0.3
#layer C 0.55
#layer A E 0.8

